'''You Monster!''' is an [[Achievement]] awarded when a [[Crawler|crawler]] kills an infant.{{cite|1|18}}

<blockquote><p>'''New achievement! You Monster! You have killed an infant! An infant! Okay, okay. Unless you're a complete psychopath, we know you probably didn't wake up this morning and tell yourself, "Today is the day I'm going to slaughter a child."'''</p>
<p>'''Reward: Bronze Loot Box.'''<ref>{{ref|1|18}} (pp. 142-143). Kindle Edition.</ref></p></blockquote>

== Trivia ==
Carl thinks about this achievement the first time he says his mantra.{{cite|3|8}}

